# Numbered equations ride in borderless three-column layout tables: a blank
# narrow left cell, OMML in the widened center, and the number at the right.
# Equal 5% gutters leave 90% of the text width to the equation. The Equation
# table style suppresses inherited rules and cell margins and zeroes the
# default table indent. Equation tables have empty captions, so they do not
# enter the Table numbering sequence.
